      "en": "You say, ‘God lays up his iniquity for his children.’ Let him recompense it to himself, that he may know it.",
      "ko": "하나님이 그의 죄악을 쌓아 두셨다가 그 자손에게 갚으신다 하거니와 그 몸에 갚으셔서 그로 깨닫게 하셔야 할 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "9afa66aa60f87645180575c2b76a84b4fd6529db3c32f532419fc1a80ccd5b42",
      "translation_text_hash": "91802570b88078305f79f845204bc2ec1acd9abbe098dec2bb52789411d988c1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
